<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran special forces have entered Haiti to search for four missing Salvadoran soldiers and four kidnapped aviation technicians after a gang ambush captured them, and President Bukele says the remains recovered are not those of the missing personnel. Haitian gangs continue to carry out violent attacks, forcing civilians to flee the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ4N2NmMGN4M21RS2E1UlJ3NFBCMlAzcVJxWGxOdDcyRXE3MHluMzJ5ZHhGblNaV3RTSVVLYUpkb2xRdHZJUFVmNW1mQlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPNEhheFZNZ2tfQ1lLWUNHT0c3T29aZ2J1LVhBSmJUczIxNGhSTzFOOUt6M1lPQnZSTnVjaUljQ2w5Rk80UUJ0cndvVzg4ZlJhLU0yUHdNVk9kZld4d2RlbC1WblBPSVRyajlmV1dlMmVXclRxQUZtV2l2ZGluTGhHRDlhNmt2dEx0cW9yd1dB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQRF9KQW1CR1hkUXlEZTFrZFZrUGh4ZjdLTWxlR3p0cElTRnk4WGpzS2JpV2FqX2ktRWJrMmxWT1o1U2swWlRLXy0tRDQ5OFZ0Y2wxUk91eV9RMGVvX3FRU2JUWDVUczk0bjNnek1aQnRJbTNaQnRmZ2ZqdlljRTNyN3hSVmNtZkVlU0lVWGFHNldZSTVST1RlWkFrcUVHclEzay1TYW05R3ExbGQtMkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNLWZpdUkweWd4RWhxV3haNFYzVWEyOGt6SGlzZ0YxQXlzTmdORVc0ZWNjSmd3RjZfQTAtR01fZVEwV01YSERCOFllTVNlRjNYZ2loMU9kZk9uVEYtTE00WkdMTTVBUVVQV29na1pCMUx4b2plVkVMY1Z1a1JDZ09rZDF1eW1EeGYwNzVaUlVublBQRE4zTWRSeUVPWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The SOFX Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOUzAxRmt6SXRWOEdtZTRkT1hIWHBLd3FGTDNaRUV2YzFYT0JDNmUwRT